2026-06-18 12:05:45 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   I am reaching out to introduce PlacementHub and explore whether there may be a strategic fit with
2026-06-18 12:05:45 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   IDP's Referral Partners in India.
2026-06-18 12:05:45 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   PlacementHub is a campus placement and employability platform working with colleges, placement cells,
2026-06-18 12:05:45 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   and graduating students across India. We are speaking with overseas education and immigration
2026-06-18 12:05:45 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   consultants who may benefit from earlier visibility in the student journey, and who may also see value
