2026-06-18 12:05:45 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   Access to students while they are still shaping career, higher education, and migration plans.
2026-06-18 12:05:45 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   College-led engagement opportunities for seminars, counselling sessions, and structured student outreach.
2026-06-18 12:05:45 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   Better context on student goals and readiness, helping your team focus on warmer and more relevant prospects.
2026-06-18 12:05:45 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   IDP's Referral Partners in India have consistently demonstrated exceptional expertise in providing comprehensive study abroad guidance, offering tailored visa support, and facilitating seamless overseas education pathways for students, thereby establishing themselves as trusted and reliable allies in the realm of international education.
